ebody is really  passionate about something and so many  people did that today but christie i  thought you did a great job of that too  so there's all kinds of practicing and  lack of jargon and that you can do but  really being  truly driven by something important to  you is there's no replacement for that  so congratulations christy and  to everybody else too  so congratulations to christy the winner  of the first ever  mcgovern story slam this very glamorous  trophy  is on its way to you as well as a giant  mcgovern  swag bag i want to thank our judges  maddy's fire and tina hesman say for  their time tonight  and i really want to thank all of you  for taking the time to join us online  and finally and most importantly i want  to thank all of our storytellers  ola jill christie merti shannon deepon  and heather  for opening up and sharing so much of  themselves with us tonight  if you enjoyed this slam please visit  the mcgovern institute website  to learn more about future events and  other ways to stay involved  thank you and have a great evening  [Music]  [Music]
 

